# Third-party licenses bundled with @PROJECT_NAME@

The plugin statically links object code from the libraries below.  Their
licenses travel with the binary; each license file is installed alongside
the plugin under `@KDE_INSTALL_DATADIR@/wek/licenses/<lib>/LICENSE`.

| Library | SPDX id | Path | Upstream |
|---|---|---|---|
| Eigen | `MPL-2.0` (primary) + `BSD-3-Clause` (some headers) | `Eigen/LICENSE` | <https://eigen.tuxfamily.org/> |
| glslang | `BSD-3-Clause` + `Apache-2.0` + others | `glslang/LICENSE` | <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glslang> |
| SPIRV-Reflect | `Apache-2.0` | `SPIRV-Reflect/LICENSE` | <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Reflect> |
| nlohmann/json | `MIT` | `nlohmann/LICENSE` | <https://github.com/nlohmann/json> |
| miniaudio | `Unlicense` OR `MIT` (dual) | `miniaudio/LICENSE` | <https://github.com/mackron/miniaudio> |
| kissfft | `BSD-3-Clause` | `kissfft/LICENSE` | <https://github.com/mborgerding/kissfft> |
| stb_image | Public-domain OR `MIT` (dual) | `stb_image/LICENSE-EMBEDDED-IN-HEADER.h` | <https://github.com/nothings/stb> |
| VulkanMemoryAllocator | `MIT` | `vk_mem_alloc/LICENSE-EMBEDDED-IN-HEADER.h` | <https://github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/VulkanMemoryAllocator> |
| argparse | `MIT` (header preamble) | source header | <https://github.com/p-ranav/argparse> |
| effolkronium/random | `MIT` (header preamble) | source header | <https://github.com/effolkronium/random> |
| glad | `MIT` (generated by glad2) | source header | <https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad> |
| vog/sha1 | header preamble | source header | (vog/sha1 vendored copy) |

## Submodules

`src/backend_scene/` is the
[`CaptSilver/wallpaper-scene-renderer`](https://github.com/CaptSilver/wallpaper-scene-renderer)
Git submodule, GPL-2.0-only.  The parent (this plugin) inherits via
submodule semantics; both are GPL-2.0-only with the vendored third-party
licenses above.

See also:
<https://github.com/CaptSilver/wallpaper-engine-kde-plugin/blob/main/LICENSE>
for the plugin's own GPL-2.0-only text.
